## 9. FAILURE HANDLING

Classify every failure precisely:

| Code | Trigger |
|------|---------|
| STATIC_FAILURE | Static check error_count > 0 |
| BUILD_FAILURE | Build success = false |
| TEST_FAILURE | Test failed > 0 |
| REGRESSION | Baseline comparison is_regression = true |
| FUNCTIONAL_DRIFT | Contract tests fail after extraction |
| MUTATION_WEAKNESS | Mutation score < threshold |
| SCOPE_VIOLATION | Git diff includes undeclared files |
| MCP_ERROR | Any MCP tool returns error field |
| BLOCKED | Insufficient data to proceed |

Maximum 3 fix attempts per failure.
After 3 attempts:
  → Mark status = STALLED in state
  → CALL migration-fs::set_state()
  → Report: failure code, all 3 attempted fixes, evidence from MCP output
  → STOP. Wait for user.

